WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.246 --> 00:00:03.520
- This is like all of my
worst fears manifested.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.571
(electronic music)

00:00:07.571 --> 00:00:10.612
- Today, I'm cutting my bestfriend's hair.

00:00:10.612 --> 00:00:11.623
(laughing)

00:00:11.623 --> 00:00:14.348
- I am very excited, actually.

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:16.324
I always love a new
haircut and I trust her.

00:00:16.324 --> 00:00:18.646
- Well, I'm thinking like a Rachel Bilson

00:00:18.646 --> 00:00:22.268
from circa OC era, you know.

00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:26.457
So, just like nice long layers,
a little bit off the length.

00:00:26.457 --> 00:00:27.759
- I want to give her bangs.

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:29.559
I think she has the face for bangs.

00:00:29.559 --> 00:00:30.488
- Oh, thanks.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.043
- Yeah, she has nice cheekbones.

00:00:32.043 --> 00:00:34.319
- I think that I can do this.

00:00:34.319 --> 00:00:35.549
I'm feeling really confident.

00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:37.198
- I hope you can do this.

00:00:37.198 --> 00:00:37.896
- I'm feeling really good.

00:00:37.896 --> 00:00:40.311
(suspenseful music)

00:00:40.311 --> 00:00:41.774
- Please don't cut my eyelashes.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:42.796
- [Carmeyn] I'm not going to.

00:00:42.796 --> 00:00:45.002
- [Lindsay] Just take
off these little ends.

00:00:45.002 --> 00:00:47.231
- Okay.

00:00:47.231 --> 00:00:49.228
- [Liz] Oh, maybe less.

00:00:49.228 --> 00:00:51.895
(laughing)

00:00:54.245 --> 00:00:56.356
- What are you doing?

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:58.242
- Just giving you dimension?

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.708
- Oh my God.

00:01:00.708 --> 00:01:02.937
(laughing)

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.189
- Okay, we're good.

00:01:05.189 --> 00:01:07.953
- [Lindsay] No, no, no. No shakes.

00:01:07.953 --> 00:01:10.901
- Why are you, why are
you talking like that?

00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.829
You're talking like an evil genius

00:01:12.829 --> 00:01:15.566
and it's making me semi-uncomfortable.

00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:19.402
(laughing)

00:01:19.402 --> 00:01:21.074
- What was that for?

00:01:21.074 --> 00:01:23.429
- Is this how you usually part your hair?

00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:27.691
- You know, I do both. I do
middle. I do some side parts.

00:01:27.691 --> 00:01:29.090
- I don't think that it will matter.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.087
I just felt like that might be comforting.

00:01:31.087 --> 00:01:31.980
(laughing)

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.140
- [Carmeyn] We've been friends
for so long, Elizabeth.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:35.626
(laughing)

00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:37.321
- Let's keep it that way.

00:01:37.321 --> 00:01:41.523
- You have very good bedside hair manner.

00:01:41.523 --> 00:01:44.937
You sound confident and
because you sound confident

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.182
I feel a little better.

00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.462
- Good.

00:01:49.462 --> 00:01:50.958
- Oh my God.

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:51.629
(laughing)

00:01:51.629 --> 00:01:53.027
- [Carmeyn] I know, I know.

00:01:53.027 --> 00:01:54.188
- It sounds like a lot.

00:01:54.188 --> 00:01:55.123
- [Lindsay] This looks good.

00:01:55.123 --> 00:01:56.153
- Does it?

00:01:56.153 --> 00:01:57.012
- [Lindsay] Oh, yeah.

00:01:57.012 --> 00:01:59.636
- So would you go out to
lunch with me like this?

00:01:59.636 --> 00:02:03.913
- Yeah, I would go to
lunch with you in any way.

00:02:03.913 --> 00:02:06.491
- What are you hoping to see
when you look in the mirror?

00:02:06.491 --> 00:02:08.418
- I'm hoping to not cry.

00:02:08.418 --> 00:02:11.405
(suspenseful music)

00:02:11.405 --> 00:02:12.672
- What? This isn't bad.

00:02:12.672 --> 00:02:13.346
- Really?

00:02:13.346 --> 00:02:14.646
- Yeah, you're good.

00:02:14.646 --> 00:02:15.781
- You think so?

00:02:17.714 --> 00:02:19.094
- [Alana] Okay.

00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:19.653
- Yeah.

00:02:19.653 --> 00:02:20.396
- Yeah, you did good.

00:02:20.396 --> 00:02:22.548
- Okay, good. I'm really glad. Oh my God.

00:02:22.548 --> 00:02:25.637
- You know, I may not even
have to go to the salon.

00:02:25.637 --> 00:02:26.542
Look at you.

00:02:26.542 --> 00:02:27.703
- I know.

00:02:27.703 --> 00:02:28.841
- We did it.

00:02:28.841 --> 00:02:29.842
- Yeah, it's like a rollercoaster.

00:02:29.842 --> 00:02:31.769
It was fun and scary at the same time.

00:02:31.769 --> 00:02:34.137
- Hey, I may be calling
you up in 3 months like,

00:02:34.137 --> 00:02:36.738
"Hey girl. Hey girl.
Hook me up with a trim."

00:02:36.738 --> 00:02:37.782
- I love her.

00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:42.034
- I love her and let's go
out. Let's go flaunt this.

00:02:42.034 --> 00:02:43.866
- I know, we're going to rock
this out to lunch right now.

00:02:43.866 --> 00:02:48.866
(electronic music)

